sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant Browser
  participant Axios as Axios agent
  participant Pipeline as ASP.NET pipeline
  participant Anti as Antiforgery
  participant Account as Account controller and service
  participant Identity as ASP.NET Core Identity
  participant SQL as Azure SQL

  User->>Browser: Submit email and password
  Browser->>Axios: Account.login(values)
  Axios->>Pipeline: GET /api/security/csrf
  Pipeline->>Anti: GetAndStoreTokens
  Anti-->>Browser: Set HttpOnly antiforgery cookie
  Anti-->>Axios: Return request token as JSON
  Axios->>Pipeline: POST /api/account/login with X-CSRF-TOKEN
  Note over Browser,Pipeline: Browser automatically sends the antiforgery cookie
  Pipeline->>Anti: Validate header and cookie pair
  Anti-->>Pipeline: Valid
  Pipeline->>Account: Bind LoginDto and run action
  Account->>Identity: PasswordSignInAsync
  Identity->>SQL: Load user and password verifier
  SQL-->>Identity: User, role membership, security stamp
  Identity->>Identity: Verify password hash and lockout rules
  Identity->>Identity: Build claims principal and protect authentication ticket
  Identity-->>Browser: Set HoaCommunityEvents.Auth as HttpOnly cookie
  Account-->>Browser: Return UserDto without a token

  Browser->>Pipeline: GET /api/account/current with auth cookie
  Pipeline->>Identity: Unprotect ticket and reconstruct HttpContext.User
  Identity->>SQL: Periodically validate security stamp
  Pipeline->>Pipeline: Evaluate ResidentOrAdmin policy
  Pipeline->>Account: Invoke current-user action
  Account->>SQL: Load current user and roles
  Account->>Identity: RefreshSignInAsync with current membership
  Identity-->>Browser: Renew protected cookie ticket
  Account-->>Browser: Return current UserDto

  User->>Browser: Choose logout
  Browser->>Axios: Account.logout()
  Axios->>Pipeline: GET /api/security/csrf after login reset
  Anti-->>Axios: Request token for current identity
  Axios->>Pipeline: POST /api/account/logout with X-CSRF-TOKEN
  Note over Browser,Pipeline: Browser automatically sends both cookies
  Pipeline->>Pipeline: Authenticate cookie and authorize logout
  Pipeline->>Anti: Validate header and cookie pair
  Pipeline->>Account: Authorized logout action
  Account->>Identity: SignOutAsync
  Identity-->>Browser: Expire authentication cookie
  Account-->>Browser: 204 No Content
